---
import BaseLayout from '../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import Prose from '../../components/Prose.astro';
import Todo from '../../components/Todo.astro';
import RelatedLinks from '../../components/RelatedLinks.astro';
import { site } from '../../data/site';

const trail = [{ name: 'Second Opinion', href: '/second-opinion/' }];
const title = 'Second Opinion on a Dental Treatment Plan | SoftDentalCare Los Algodones';
const description =
  'Dr. Garibay reviews the treatment plan and x-rays you were given in the United States and tells you what he would do, what it costs and how long it takes.';
---

<BaseLayout title={title} description={description} trail={trail}>
  <Prose>
    <h1 class="text-3xl font-semibold">A second opinion from {site.dentist}</h1>

    <p class="border-l-4 border-accent bg-sand px-4 py-3">
      <strong>This is our own opinion, not a neutral assessment.</strong> {site.name} is the practice
      that would carry out the treatment, so we have an interest in the answer. We are not a review
      board, an insurer or an independent service, and we do not present ourselves as one. What you
      get here is what {site.dentist} would do in your case and what it would cost with us.
    </p>

    <h2>How it works</h2>
    <ol>
      <li>You send us the written estimate and the x-rays you received in the United States.</li>
      <li>{site.dentist} looks at the case himself.</li>
      <li>
        You get his reading of what is needed, what it costs at {site.name} and how many days on
        site it takes.
      </li>
    </ol>
    <p>
      If you would rather have someone look at your plan who does not treat you, ask for an opinion
      somewhere that has no stake in it. That is a fair thing to want and we will say so.
    </p>
    <Todo needs="How long the reply takes, whether the review is free, and who exactly reviews the case." />

    <h2>Sending your files</h2>
    <Todo needs="Upload route is not built yet. It runs as a PHP handler on Hostinger and stores files outside the web root, never in public_html. Retention period and who may access the files still have to be set, and both belong in the privacy policy." />

    <h2>The legal part</h2>
    <Todo needs="Legal check should also confirm the wording that identifies this as an SDC offer rather than a neutral assessment, since we do treat the patients we advise." />
    <Todo needs="Wording must be checked by a lawyer before publication: a remote assessment is not a diagnosis and does not create a treatment relationship. Do not publish this page before that check is done." />
  </Prose>
  <RelatedLinks
    related={[
      { href: '/prices/', label: 'Price ranges' },
      { href: '/dental-implants/', label: 'Dental implants' },
    ]}
  />
</BaseLayout>
